SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the source code in this repository
(`fpu_event_study.py`) only.

The dissertation text (`thesis.pdf`), the announcement panels in `data/`, and
the estimation output in `results/` are the author's academic work and are
made available for reading and for academic replication, with attribution.
They are not placed under the MIT licence.

Surprises in the announcement panels are derived from Reuters consensus
forecasts. The underlying vendor forecast values are not redistributed here.
